WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.010 --> 00:00:07.430
What's up everybody!

00:00:07.430 --> 00:00:08.430
We are Pongfinity

00:00:08.430 --> 00:00:10.660
Today we are playing Jenga battles

00:00:11.260 --> 00:00:13.320
We are going to see

00:00:13.320 --> 00:00:15.080
Whose tower makes it the highest!

00:00:17.220 --> 00:00:19.520
Rock-paper-scissors who gets to start

00:00:25.840 --> 00:00:29.160
The loser will face a punishment at the end!

00:00:33.560 --> 00:00:34.940
That's 2 for me

00:00:46.740 --> 00:00:48.660
You almost got one from this side!

00:01:00.120 --> 00:01:01.740
Double shot again!

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:03.720
That's unfair!

00:01:08.800 --> 00:01:11.040
I will also start doing doubles!

00:01:22.560 --> 00:01:23.580
Miikka won!

00:01:23.580 --> 00:01:25.520
No, you have to get 1 more

00:01:25.520 --> 00:01:26.660
We are even right now

00:01:26.760 --> 00:01:27.560
True!

00:01:34.960 --> 00:01:36.560
Winner!

00:01:49.480 --> 00:01:50.880
I'm going to win this one!

00:01:58.720 --> 00:02:00.160
Let's take that one then...

00:02:03.080 --> 00:02:04.580
Did I get it?

00:02:04.700 --> 00:02:05.780
Yup!

00:02:07.680 --> 00:02:10.880
I can already say that I won't lose this battle!

00:02:13.440 --> 00:02:14.400
Good job!

00:02:14.480 --> 00:02:16.080
The tower is looking great!

00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:49.100
Looking a bit dodgy, Otto.

00:02:49.920 --> 00:02:50.640
Go for it!

00:02:57.520 --> 00:03:00.000
Actually it's even right now

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:01.840
I have to get one more

00:03:09.920 --> 00:03:11.920
How many blocks was that?

00:03:12.880 --> 00:03:16.400
That's a draw!

00:03:20.340 --> 00:03:21.380
You can start

00:03:47.680 --> 00:03:49.340
You still have to get 1 more block!

00:03:51.000 --> 00:03:52.140
The winner!

00:03:54.340 --> 00:03:56.120
Emil, that was so bad!

00:03:57.880 --> 00:03:59.680
It still won't fall!

00:04:00.560 --> 00:04:02.700
It's all about the building!

00:04:03.560 --> 00:04:04.800
Good match!

00:04:05.300 --> 00:04:07.100
That means Miikka won.

00:04:07.300 --> 00:04:09.480
I guess we will have to take a re-match

00:04:09.600 --> 00:04:11.800
To see who is the loser

00:04:11.800 --> 00:04:13.840
I think that the last match was so bad from
you Emil

00:04:13.840 --> 00:04:15.940
That you lost the whole tournament

00:04:17.400 --> 00:04:19.140
Otto lost the re-match...

00:04:19.140 --> 00:04:21.300
I have made a tower...

00:04:21.340 --> 00:04:23.760
Otto gets to keep it on top of his head

00:04:25.080 --> 00:04:27.660
I'm not sure if it's going to stay there

00:04:28.860 --> 00:04:29.780
Voilá!

00:04:32.780 --> 00:04:34.620
Are you trying to hit me?

00:04:38.680 --> 00:04:40.060
That's one!

00:04:41.460 --> 00:04:42.680
First one!

00:04:44.340 --> 00:04:45.960
Wow, second one!

00:04:53.620 --> 00:04:56.800
This is going better than the actual game!

00:05:04.260 --> 00:05:06.100
I wasn't even aiming at the tower

00:05:11.700 --> 00:05:13.380
I think that was 4 or 5 blocks

00:05:14.480 --> 00:05:16.060
You did a good job!

00:05:16.840 --> 00:05:17.920
Thanks for watching guys

00:05:17.960 --> 00:05:19.140
This was Jenga battles

00:05:19.150 --> 00:05:20.380
Leave your comments and ideas

00:05:20.380 --> 00:05:21.970
For the next battle we should do!

00:05:21.970 --> 00:05:24.000
Until next time!

